6 MAD/m³ 180,750 401,250 621,750
10 MAD/m³ 390,750 751,250 1,111,750
12 MAD/m³ 495,750 926,250 1,356,750

If \lambda = 0, subtract 875,000 MAD from each cell. For example, at 10 MAD/m³ and 25% reduction, \text{NCF}(0) = -123{,}750 MAD. The investment case strengthens as water cost rises and as \lambda \to 1.

